[{"code":"not_implemented","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Pages.beni","start":{"line":26,"col":16},"end":{"line":26,"col":22}},"title":"NOT IMPLEMENTED YET","message":"A limit of the compiler: this event's handler value is not one constructor that\ntakes the event's payload or nothing, so `browser-inline` evaluates it at the\nevent, inside the call of the function this markup is in; an argument of that\ncall is not proved pure and total, and another module's markup does not keep the\narguments its binding evaluated yet (`docs/design/browser-inline.md` §8.7; §5,\nclass 4). The program is valid: it builds with `--platform=browser-tea`."}]
